{{!
    @template format_streamdeck/local/discussion

    An episode's discussion as a thread: the opening post, a reply bar, and the replies nested under what they
    answer. Reply, edit and delete open mod_forum's own form in a composer under the post (amd/src/main.js).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * discussionid - int - The discussion
    * name - string - Discussion name
    * forumname - string - Forum name
    * discussionurl - string - The full discussion page
    * replycount - string - "3 replies"
    * opening - object - The opening post (see format_streamdeck/local/discussion_post)
    * replies - array - Replies to the opening post
    * hasreplies - bool - Whether there are replies
    * canreply - bool - Whether the learner can reply to the opening post
    * replyurl - string - Reply form for the opening post
    * useravatar - string - The learner's picture
    * backtolist - bool - Whether a list of discussions can be returned to

    Example context (json):
    {
        "discussionid": 3, "name": "What is a noun?", "forumname": "Lecture questions",
        "discussionurl": "#", "replycount": "1 reply", "hasreplies": true, "canreply": true,
        "replyurl": "#", "useravatar": "", "backtolist": false,
        "opening": {"id": 1, "author": "Sam Student", "avatar": "", "time": "2 hours ago", "datetime": "",
            "isodate": "2026-10-31T21:00:00+00:00",
            "message": "<p>Can someone explain nouns?</p>", "depth": 0, "children": []},
        "replies": []
    }
}}
<div class="sd-thread" data-region="sd-thread" data-discussionid="{{discussionid}}">
    <header class="sd-thread-header">
        {{#backtolist}}
            <button type="button" class="sd-icon-btn sd-thread-back" data-action="sd-discussion-back"
                    aria-label="{{#str}}alldiscussions, format_streamdeck{{/str}}"
                    title="{{#str}}alldiscussions, format_streamdeck{{/str}}">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
        {{/backtolist}}
        <div class="sd-thread-heading">
            <span class="sd-thread-kicker">{{forumname}}</span>
            <h3 class="sd-thread-title">{{name}}</h3>
            <span class="sd-thread-meta">{{replycount}}</span>
        </div>
        <a class="sd-icon-btn sd-thread-open" href="{{discussionurl}}"
           aria-label="{{#str}}openfulldiscussion, format_streamdeck{{/str}}"
           title="{{#str}}openfulldiscussion, format_streamdeck{{/str}}">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </a>
    </header>

    {{#opening}}
        <article class="sd-post sd-post--opening" data-region="sd-post" data-postid="{{id}}" id="sd-post-{{id}}">
            {{> format_streamdeck/local/discussion_post_body}}
        </article>
    {{/opening}}

    {{#canreply}}
        <div class="sd-reply-bar" data-region="sd-composer-slot" data-postid="{{opening.id}}">
            {{#useravatar}}<img class="sd-avatar" src="{{useravatar}}" alt="">{{/useravatar}}
            <button type="button" class="sd-reply-bar-button" data-action="sd-compose" data-url="{{replyurl}}">
                {{#str}}addreply, format_streamdeck{{/str}}
            </button>
        </div>
    {{/canreply}}

    {{#hasreplies}}
        <ol class="sd-replies" aria-label="{{replycount}}">
            {{#replies}}
                <li class="sd-reply" data-depth="{{depth}}">
                    {{> format_streamdeck/local/discussion_post}}
                </li>
            {{/replies}}
        </ol>
    {{/hasreplies}}
</div>
